{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"MIC","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"彌迦書","commonName":"彌迦書","title":"彌迦書","order":33,"numberOfChapters":7,"sha256":"7653aa64f11ed5e86b64f5806ce4393d656010dca6eac643843bbaa97a4000ce","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/MIC/1.json","lastChapterNumber":7,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/MIC/7.json","totalNumberOfVerses":105},"chapter":{"number":3,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["斥責以色列的領袖"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"我說：「雅各的首領，以色列家的統治者啊！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們要聽！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"難道你們不知正義嗎？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"然而，你們憎惡良善，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"喜愛邪惡，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"剝下我百姓的皮，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"從他們的骨頭上剔肉。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們吃我百姓的肉，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"剝我百姓的皮，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"打碎他們的骨頭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"把他們切成塊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如同下在鍋裡、放進釜中的肉。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們遭難的時候，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"向耶和華呼求，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂必不應允你們。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因你們的惡行，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂必掩面不顧你們。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"text":"耶和華說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「使我的子民步入歧途的先知啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們向供養你們的人報平安，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"出言攻擊那不供養你們的人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此，黑夜必籠罩你們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使你們看不見異象；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"幽暗必臨到你們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使你們無法占卜。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"太陽要為先知沉落，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"白晝變為黑夜。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"先見必抱愧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"占卜者必蒙羞。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因得不到上帝的答覆，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們都必羞愧地捂著臉。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"至於我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因有耶和華的靈，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我充滿權能、正義和力量，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"能向雅各宣告他的過犯，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"向以色列宣告他的罪惡。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"雅各家的首領，以色列家的統治者啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們要聽！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們厭惡正義，顛倒是非；","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以血腥建立錫安，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以罪惡建造耶路撒冷。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"城裡的首領為貪贓而枉法，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祭司為銀子而施教，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"先知為錢財而占卜。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們卻宣稱倚靠耶和華，說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「耶和華不是在我們當中嗎？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"災禍不會臨到我們。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以，因你們的緣故，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"錫安必被夷為平地，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶路撒冷必淪為廢墟，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"聖殿山必成為長滿荒林的高崗。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/MIC/3.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/MIC/4.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/MIC/2.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":12}